\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i1 I cant remember how I got here but the setting is very familiar. The full moon is casting a spotlight along the stone edge of the water.  Suddenly the Earth tilts 90 degrees. Now the river is more like a mirror hanging in front of me and I notice a figure on the other side of the liquid surface. The details of the woman\loch\af1\hich\af1\dbch\af1\uc1\u8217\'92s face were hard to see through the cloudy water.  Long dark hair floated around her like a graceful shadow as she looked all around. The woman\u8217\'92s outstretched arms frantically searched for something.  A way out?  A hand stretched in my direction and I realized she was reaching for me. Im terrified but I cant just leave her to a watery grave.  I stretched my arm out toward her until our fingertips met. The cloudy water started to clear just as my fingers broke the surface. I feel cold metal instead of damp flesh. Then as if I have tripped an alarm an loud beeping starts.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn gasped and coughed she sat up in bed. She was in her bed. In her room. Safe. The digital clock on her dresser read 8:16. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93At least I didn\u8217\'92t oversleep today\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f1\fs24\b0\i1 Knock Knock Knock}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Are you up?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn realized she was grasping the ring that hung around her neck. Something she often did when she was scared or uneasy.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Uh Um Yeah. I\u8217\'92ll be out in a minute.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Are you ok?\u8221\'94 \u8220\'93You sound weird\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn took a deep calming breath before replying.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Vi I\u8217\'92m fine. Not everyone can be like you in the mornings Susie Sunshine.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Fine\u8221\'94 Violet laughed But muffins are fresh out of the oven and I need a taste tester.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Mmmm.\u8221\'94\u8221\'94 Ok but I need like 15 to get ready for work first.\u8221\'94 Autumn responded}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Violet was attempting to perfect her cranberry orange flavored muffins this week. And since Violet was an amazing cook Autumn had no problem being the taste tester.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The smell of disinfectant and hand sanitizer filled her nose as she tried to gain her bearings.  Looking around the room, Autumn clutched the silver ring that alway hung from the gold chain around her neck It took a few blinks to focus in the dimly lit room. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 A hospital?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Why\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8230\'85}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Suddenly Autumn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s sluggish mind coughed up the events of the day. It was like a slide show was playing in her mind. She remembered donning her U-Store It t-shirt, grabbing her backpack and a muffin and heading out the door. Her roommate Violet was attempting to perfect cranberry orange flavored muffins this week. Great for breakfast on the go. Autumn couldn\u8217\'92t help but take a bite as she walked out the door.  The roses they had planted near the front door were looking great. A few red buds where already showing life. Autumn had alway seemed to have a green thumb. Even as a child planting things that could grow and produce something beautiful had fascinated her.  As an adult Autumn kind of like to think of herself as a flower that could produce beauty in her artwork. Artwork that one day would be appreciated. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0  But for now Autumn hopped in her blue Honda hatchback and headed off to work.  The homemade breakfast confection perfumed the cabin. The smell of oranges always made her feel happy. But anything that Violet cooked had that effect. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 It happened so suddenly. Just as she started to cross Webb Creek there was a loud }{\f1\fs24\b0\i1 Bang}{\f0\fs24\b0\i0  and the steering wheel jerked to the right. On a reaction Autumn pulled to left. Over correcting made things worse. Thank goodness she didn't end up in the creek. The guard rail stopped the Honda\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92s forward progress. But the sudden stopped caused her head to bang the driver side window and then everything went black.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn! I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m so glad you\u8217\'92re ok. Violet said as she rushed to the side of the hospital bed. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Violet sat on the bed and quickly wrapped her arms around Autumn. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Oh Autumn I was so worried. Doug called and said you never made it to work. I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m so sorry that this happened to you. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m alright. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I think I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m alright. No broken bones at least. Besides if was an accident.  I think my tire blew.  I guess I waited too long to replace them. I\u8217\'92m just glad no one else was hurt.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 So am I said Violet.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 How long have I been here?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 You left for work at 8:30 and the hospital called me around 10.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 What time is it now?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Just after 5:00.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 You\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92ve been here all day?}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Of course. Thats what family is for.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 She and Violet were not related by blood but had formed a bond as close as sister.  Autumn had been looking for a new roommate and Violet found one of her flyers.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Talk about bad luck. Autumn had lost her keys, nearly set fire to the breakroom at work. Now this car accident. }
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 In walked a tall thin man in a long white coat.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Good afternoon Miss North. I\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92m Dr. Moore. I am glad to see you\u8217\'92re up and alert.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Thanks. So when can I go home?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 We need to observe you overnight due to the head injury.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Autumn reached for the injury near her hairline and winced.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 I feel fine Doc.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 25 years old with no pre existing health conditions. Im sure you\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92ll make a full recovery. But hospital policy for a head injury and loss of consciousness is an overnight stay.  ke}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Now I need to check out a few other things now that you are awake.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Thank you for being so thorough Doctor Said Violet}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Yeah thanks.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 You are very welcome Miss North. }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0       *** }
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Jack gazed out over the hill at the sun rise. He knew the view extremely well. The same canopy of  trees. The same rushing stream that trickled its way down the mountain. This was always his reward for his morning run. This view reminded him of why he worked so hard. But today he just need time to think away from the rest of the guys.  Peace and quite.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Jack\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Hey Jack\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Fuck. I don\u8217\'92t need a run partner or a baby sitter, Carver\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0  \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93I know you asked for space but the queen has requested an audience.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93When?\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Now.\u8221\'94}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8220\'93Alright. Have all the guys been informed?}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 No. You dont understand. The queen requested a private audience with you.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 Shit.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i0 The queen had asked for a private meeting with him. She probably had finally gotten sick of his shit. Getting black out intoxicated wasn\loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u8217\'92t such a great idea. Especially when your whole reason for being was to stay alert and protect those in your care. Unfortunately losing someone in your care made it fucking hard to sleep. With sleep came the nightmares. The replay of that night that Jack would never forget.}
\par\plain \f0\fs24\b0\i0
